{"product_id":"heavenly-cross-stitch-designs-with-a-christian-theme","title":"Heavenly Cross-Stitch: Designs With a Christian Theme","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnjoy the inspiration of cross-stitch projects that draw on Bible themes. Some echo the glory of cathedral stained glass and Old Masters; others draw upon Early American samplers that taught children both their ABCs and their manners. Imaginative Christmas designs feature The Road To Bethlehem, Mary and the Christ-Child, and the Nativity. Other themes from the life of Christ include Jesus and the Children, The Last Supper, and The Lion and the Lamb. A heavenly host of angels also appear, including adorable Puppy, Squirrel, Bear, Bunny, and Kitten angels. A Family Tree, a Little Red Church, and Noah's Ark add to the variety -- 32 in all.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 203 x 273\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Marie Barber\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780806903491\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45174664724633,"sku":"5RB9780806903491","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67bc14515dd76_Heavenly_20Cross-Stitch-_20Designs_20With_20a_20Christian_20Theme_20Marie_20Barber.jpg?v=1740490926","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/heavenly-cross-stitch-designs-with-a-christian-theme","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}